  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the dolsot stone bowl to 450°F (230°C).",
    "In a large bowl, combine rye flour, yeast, and salt. Gradually add warm water, mixing until a sticky dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 10 minutes until smooth and elastic.",
    "Cover the dough with plastic wrap and let rise in a warm place for 1 hour.",
    "Preheat a non-stick skillet over medium-high heat. Add sesame oil and swirl to coat.",
    "Add the dough to the skillet and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side, or until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Transfer the dough to the preheated dolsot stone bowl and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until crispy and fragrant.",
    "Top the yeast bowl with a mixture of pickle juice, scallions, grated carrot, diced beetroot, salted fermented soybeans, and chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
